roomDescription = "You stroll among the outer edges of the central chamber, the guard's lights are dimmer in this location and nowhere near as blinding, yet they're still bright. Inmates are often found wandering this area, Reds, Oranges and Lilacs alike. Though, Lilacs are very rarely seen in the central chamber for quite valid reasons.

