roomDescription = "A heavily armored guard watches over the checkpoint, monitoring inmates and patting them down as they pass through. This guard looks exceptionally brutish and you wouldn't want to get on this guy's bad side. Might not be a good idea to try and sneak in contraband while he's around..."
